				Hint: {
					DevSet: Developer or supporter set: a rare extra drop when you open a Treasure Bag from a Hardmode boss.
					AnglerFish: Angler quest fish: it can be caught only while the Angler asks for it (talk to him for today's quest); hand it in for a reward.
					MusicBox: Record it: put an empty Music Box in an accessory slot while this song plays; it may turn into this music box.
					Block: A natural block: mine it where it appears in the world.
					Furniture: Usually found placed in the world (houses, dungeons, the Underworld, biome structures): break it with a pickaxe or hammer to take it.
				}

				NoKnownSource: The game does not report where this item comes from. It is probably found in the world (chests, structures) or given by an NPC or event.
