				OpenForSources: Click for where to get it

				Warning: {
					Terraria_RodofDiscordCal: Never use it in the Abyss: teleporting there (Chaos State) summons the Primordial Wyrm at any point of the game.
					CalamityMod_CausticTear: Used before the Eye of Cthulhu is defeated (or before Hardmode) it is consumed but starts nothing.
					Terraria_GuideVoodooDoll: Thrown into lava in the Underworld while the Guide is alive, it kills the Guide and summons the Wall of Flesh. Winning starts Hardmode.
					CalamityMod_Terminus: Using it starts Boss Rush (hold to channel); use it again to stop.
					CatalystMod_AstralCommunicator: It stops working after the Moon Lord unless Astrageldon was already defeated.
				}

				Special: {
					Terraria_LifeCrystal: Glowing hearts in the Underground and Cavern layers: break them with a pickaxe.
					Terraria_TorchGodsFavor: Reward for surviving the Torch God event: place 101 torches close together underground.
					Terraria_LifeFruit: Grows on Jungle grass in the underground Jungle once any mechanical boss is defeated.
					CalamityMod_Terminus: Found in the chest of the Abyss shrine at the very bottom of the Abyss. The Primordial Wyrm also drops it.
					CalamityMod_DesertMedallion: Found in chests in the Underground Desert. It is not consumed when used.
					NoxusBoss_DormantKey: Given by Permafrost (the Archmage) as thanks for freeing him, after Cryogen is defeated. Show it to Solyn.
					NoxusBoss_StrangeFlagpole: Solyn gives you one when she wants to set up camp. Place it on open, flat ground.
					CalamityFables_StormlionLarvaItem: Stormlion grubs live above the dunes of the desert; catch one with a bug net.
				}
			}

